    Gary Gregory.
    </code></pre>
    </li>
    <li>
    <pre><code> Bump org.codehaus.mojo:animal-sniffer-maven-plugin from 1.23
    to 1.24 [#293](https://github.com/apache/commons-codec/issues/293).
