    </code></pre>
    </li>
    <li>
    <pre><code> Bump org.codehaus.mojo:taglist-maven-plugin from 3.0.0 to
    3.1.0 [#292](https://github.com/apache/commons-codec/issues/292). Thanks
    to Dependabot.
    </code></pre>
    </li>
    </ul>
    <p>For complete information on Apache Commons Codec, including
